# Lt. Arex, Ever-Adapting: "Strange new worlds - Lt. Arex's power and toughness are each equal to ..." is a
# characteristic-defining ability (CR 604.3); a creature that loses all abilities loses it, and with no other P/T source
# its power and toughness are the `.lost_pt` value the ability names - 0/0 - so a state-based action puts it into its
# owner's graveyard (CR 704.5f). Dress Down makes creatures lose all abilities (CR 613.1f); Lt. Arex then dies as a 0/0.

